Package: airguard360
Type: Project
Title: AIRGUARD 360: Air Quality Intelligence, Multi-Pollutant Analytics & Environmental Decision-Support System
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: person("Subrat", "Panigrahi", email = "subrat.panigrahi@lpu.in", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interactive, reproducible environmental data science pipeline and decision-support system
    developed natively in R for INT232 (Data Science Toolbox - R Programming) at Lovely Professional University.
    Investigates 108,035 station-day records across 230 CAAQMS monitoring stations and 29,531 city-day records
    across 26 Indian metropolitan hubs from 2015 to 2020. Incorporates multi-table relational SQLite storage,
    statistical hypothesis testing, ARIMA time-series forecasting against naive baselines, advisory text mining,
    and responsive bilingual dashboards in Shiny and R Markdown.
